	<td nowrap align="left"><font size="5"> Introducing Gary and Chris,<br> a travelling father-son bicycling team. <br>We scour the lands of San Diego<br> and find people who share their<br> wisdom, humor, and stories. <br>We believe that <font color="blue">everyone<br> is an open book</font color> just waiting to be <br>discovered. <p></p> Welcome to "Keepin it Real'<br><em> <strong>the story within a story</strong></em>.   
