<table width="60%"bgcolor="#d0d0d5" align="center" border="1" cellpadding="20">
 <tr>
	<td><font size="5"><center>The premise is simple.  Your hosts, Gary and Chris, ages 48 and 73, will delve into various conversations with random folks on the streets of San Diego. We always ask permission first and treat everyone with respect and consideration.   These are short clips (about six minutes each) with new content updated weekly.  This is a non-profit-for-fun, grassroots venture.<p></p> Please bookmark our website <a href="https://www.keepinitreal.us">www.keepinitreal.us</a> and thank your for your interest!</font></center></td>
 </tr>
